        <div class="o-grid o-grid--large">
            <div class="o-grid__cell u-3/5@desktop">
                                    <div class="c-event-content__important-info c-content"><p class="lead-p"><strong>Urban jazz, tap and percussion collide in this high-energy phenomenon.</strong></p>
<hr />
<p>Icarus – a young actor – is already a big hit on screen. Yet, behind the scenes, he’s under the oppressive influence of his director. After an epic argument, Icarus finds himself unable to escape the film director’s stranglehold.</p>
<p>This is a spectacular show that brings tap dance to new heights. <strong>Stories’</strong> creators –<strong> RB Dance Company</strong> – were launched onto the world stage when the company reached the finals of France’s Got Talent both in 2018 and 2024. The company brings together urban jazz, tap and percussion in a captivating showcase of physicality.</p>
<p>After touring in Europe with audiences of over 300,000 people and a sold-out first run at the Peacock Theatre in 2024, the critically-acclaimed Stories is coming back to London for 20 new performances!</p>
<p class="smaller-p">Header image © Elliot Aubin</p>
<p class="smaller-p">Header image description: A group of dancers on a smokey dark stage. They wear dark clothes including long black coats. They are all jumping, with their feet just off the floor, and their arms raised to the sides.</p>
</div>
                            </div>
